      "writtenOn": "2026-02-25T14:37:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This isn\u0027t right IMHO. This checks that the user has the `SUBMIT` permission on the target branch of the branch, but that\u0027s not what the `%submit` option should check on the receive-commit.\n\nThe `UPDATE_BY_SUBMIT` permission should be checked against the `refs/for/\u003ctarget ref\u003e` and not against `\u003ctarget ref\u003e`.\n\nSee `ReceiveCommit.java:2361`:\n\n```\n      if (magicBranch.submit) {\n        err \u003d checkRefPermission(magicBranch.perm, RefPermission.UPDATE_BY_SUBMIT);\n        if (err.isPresent()) {\n          rejectProhibited(cmd, err.get());\n          return;\n        }\n      }\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 752,
        "startChar": 14,
        "endLine": 752,
        "endChar": 64
      },
      "revId": "680fa1a2fe549657feb43054eed110954b1e17cc",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
